    "title": "Lake Taylor's Magerald Clark opens season with dominant game against Heritage in Titans 59-0 win - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Craig Loper ,\n6 hours ago\nNORFOLK (WAVY) – After an all-state junior campaign in which he had 12 interceptions, Lake Taylor’s Magerald Clark started his senior season with a bang against Heritage.\nClark accounted for more than 150 all-purpose yards and had two touchdowns, including returning the opening kick for a score.\nJames Kattato has more in the story above.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WAVY.com.",
